# HR Management App — Walkthrough

## Overview
Built a full HR Management module for the TD Games Platform. The app manages fulltime and freelancer personnel data, serving as the centralized source of truth for the ecosystem.

## What Was Built

### Database (Supabase)
8 new tables with RLS, auto-trigger for employee codes, and seeded department data:
- `hr_employees`, `hr_departments`, `hr_contracts`, `hr_position_history`
- `hr_evaluations`, `hr_project_history`, `hr_documents`, `hr_reminders`

### Frontend Components

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| [HrApp.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/HrApp.tsx) | Main shell with 3 tabs |
| [EmployeeList.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeList.tsx) | Search, filter, summary cards |
| [EmployeeForm.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeForm.tsx) | Conditional fulltime/freelancer form |
| [EmployeeDetail.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeDetail.tsx) | Detail view with sub-tabs |
| [DepartmentManager.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/DepartmentManager.tsx) | CRUD for departments |
| [ReminderDashboard.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/ReminderDashboard.tsx) | Auto-scan reminders |
| [hrService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/hrService.ts) | Supabase CRUD service |
| [useHrState.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/hooks/useHrState.ts) | State management hook |

### Integration
- Registered in [apps.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/config/apps.ts) and [App.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/App.tsx)
- File storage: **Cloudflare R2** (confirmed, to be implemented for document uploads)

## Bug Fixed During Testing
PostgREST returned **PGRST201** (ambiguous FK) because `hr_employees` and `hr_departments` have two FK relationships (`department_id` and `manager_id`). Fixed by using explicit FK hint: `!hr_employees_department_id_fkey`. Also switched `Promise.all` → `Promise.allSettled` in `loadAll` for resilient parallel loading.

